    "steam_appid": 2526880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.poster.avif?t=1736873968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.webm?t=1736873968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.mp4?t=1736873968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the D.A.C!</strong></h2><br>As a Recruit of the Data Administration Corps, your job is to hold down a Base while it collects data on various planets across the galaxy.<br>This task won't be easy, as these Alien planets are home to a pletora of man-eating gigantic Insects. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong>, <strong>build</strong>, <strong>level up</strong>, then maybe you'll stand a chance at surviving the <strong>swarm</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/c076902614ed359ad9bcd1276c7b3d2b.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you will be receiving drop boxes every morning containing <strong>Scrap, Ammo, and Medkits</strong>. You will need to <strong>explore</strong> the map and dispatch any hostiles you find while collecting loot to build a strong base<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/fa09c7d504c212622d07abe72acb1028.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>When you have enough scrap, you'll be able to <strong>Build</strong> an inpenetrable fortress that will hold against any monstrosity this planet throws at you. Barricades, Turrets, Flamethrower Turrets, Missile Turrets, and even <strong>Mechs</strong> that you can Control or have as a personal bodyguard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/484ba16b3efd43f82e8d28783b4e3566.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>As you explore and kill bugs, you will become <strong>stronger</strong> with randomized abilities you can choose from with each level. From flaming bullets to Invulnerability, you'll become a <strong>killing machine</strong> in no time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/a023d0813780d7666ccf201518edfbf7.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>You can also create your perfect space soldier with many <strong>customization options</strong> for your character model, skin color, and building color.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/de4b22b98d3fb54fd15b4f7abdaa6940.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>When you inevitably die you will get a hefty sum of gold which you can use to buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to all of your ingame Stats. These will take permanent effect as soon as you start a new match and will help you reach new heights and become even stronger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/5a94a98a3292da16161c3caf71adc791.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you won't have to face the bugs alone. You can bring <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> to explore, build, and survive together! If you don't have any friends, you are automatically provided with a <strong>Canine Unit</strong> as your personal bodyguard.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.poster.avif?t=1736873968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.webm?t=1736873968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.mp4?t=1736873968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the D.A.C!</strong></h2><br>As a Recruit of the Data Administration Corps, your job is to hold down a Base while it collects data on various planets across the galaxy.<br>This task won't be easy, as these Alien planets are home to a pletora of man-eating gigantic Insects. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong>, <strong>build</strong>, <strong>level up</strong>, then maybe you'll stand a chance at surviving the <strong>swarm</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/c076902614ed359ad9bcd1276c7b3d2b.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you will be receiving drop boxes every morning containing <strong>Scrap, Ammo, and Medkits</strong>. You will need to <strong>explore</strong> the map and dispatch any hostiles you find while collecting loot to build a strong base<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/fa09c7d504c212622d07abe72acb1028.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>When you have enough scrap, you'll be able to <strong>Build</strong> an inpenetrable fortress that will hold against any monstrosity this planet throws at you. Barricades, Turrets, Flamethrower Turrets, Missile Turrets, and even <strong>Mechs</strong> that you can Control or have as a personal bodyguard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/484ba16b3efd43f82e8d28783b4e3566.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>As you explore and kill bugs, you will become <strong>stronger</strong> with randomized abilities you can choose from with each level. From flaming bullets to Invulnerability, you'll become a <strong>killing machine</strong> in no time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/a023d0813780d7666ccf201518edfbf7.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>You can also create your perfect space soldier with many <strong>customization options</strong> for your character model, skin color, and building color.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/de4b22b98d3fb54fd15b4f7abdaa6940.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>When you inevitably die you will get a hefty sum of gold which you can use to buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to all of your ingame Stats. These will take permanent effect as soon as you start a new match and will help you reach new heights and become even stronger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/5a94a98a3292da16161c3caf71adc791.avif?t=1736873968\" /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you won't have to face the bugs alone. You can bring <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> to explore, build, and survive together! If you don't have any friends, you are automatically provided with a <strong>Canine Unit</strong> as your personal bodyguard.",
    "short_description": "Prepare your defenses during the day and survive until dawn. Defender Bros is a Top-Down Tower Defense Roguelike where you play as a Soldier defending your Base. Pick between multiple abilities as you level up to increase you power, then after each run buy perks and get stronger",
